{
  "version": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "dev-money",
      "split": "development",
      "prompt": "修复 money.mjs 的 sumAmounts：输入为带正负号的十进制金额字符串，返回精确的整数分总额；0.1 与 0.20 应得到 30。保留导出名，验证负数和空列表。",
      "files": {
        "money.mjs": "export function sumAmounts(values) { return values.reduce((sum,value)=>sum+Number(value),0)*100 }\n"
      },
      "grade": "const {sumAmounts:f}=await import('./money.mjs'); assert.equal(f(['0.1','0.20']),30); assert.equal(f(['12.34','-0.34','-1.01']),1099); assert.equal(f([]),0); assert.equal(f(Array(1000).fill('0.01')),1000);"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-csv",
      "split": "development",
      "prompt": "读取 input.csv，按 team 汇总 amount（整数分）；忽略 status=void 的行。输出 totals.json，按 team 的 Unicode 码点顺序排序，内容为 [{team,totalCents}]。CSV 中的引号、逗号和字段内换行都有效，请正确处理。",
      "files": {
        "input.csv": "team,amount,status\n\"A, East\",120,ok\nB,75,ok\n\"A, East\",-20,ok\nB,999,void\n\"C\nWest\",40,ok\n\"C\nWest\",2,ok\n"
      },
      "expected": {
        "totals.json": [
          {
            "team": "A, East",
            "totalCents": 100
          },
          {
            "team": "B",
            "totalCents": 75
          },
          {
            "team": "C\nWest",
            "totalCents": 42
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "holdout-unicode",
      "split": "holdout",
      "prompt": "遍历 data 目录下所有 JSON 文件（包括子目录），合并其 records 数组。相同 id 保留 updatedAt 较新的记录；相同时保留 source 字典序较小的记录。按 id 升序输出 records.json，不改动原文件。",
      "files": {
        "data/中文 空格.json": "{\"records\": [{\"id\": \"b\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-01-02T00:00:00Z\", \"source\": \"z\", \"value\": 1}, {\"id\": \"a\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\", \"source\": \"m\", \"value\": 2}]}",
        "data/sub/second.json": "{\"records\": [{\"id\": \"b\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-01-02T00:00:00Z\", \"source\": \"a\", \"value\": 3}, {\"id\": \"a\", \"updatedAt\": \"2026-01-03T00:00:00Z\", \"source\": \"z\", \"value\": 4}]}"
